e of  Virginia's education which is multiple  Pathways for kids with computer science  being a very important one  Governor Glenn young good to spend some  time with you thanks very much for the  spending uh some time with us this  Monday afternoon appreciate it  always always great to be with you and I  appreciate you letting me join you all  right thank you we'll see you again soon  hey Sean Hannity here hey click here to  subscribe to Fox News YouTube page and  catch our hottest interviews and most  compelling analysis you will not get it  anywhere else

